    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "298 Galtymore Road, Drimnagh, Dublin 12\r\nDavid Ross Estate Agents your local property experts are proud to present new to the market for sale No: 298 Galtymore Road, a beautiful 2 bed 2 bath extended terrace house situated right in the heart of the ever popular area of Drimnagh.\r\nSituated on Galtymore Road and only a stone’s throw from the City Centre, this property will provide its lucky new owner with a quiet residential location and yet is within easy reach of all local amenities, including excellent schools, shops, parks, sporting facilities, and public transport on your doorstep.\r\nWarmth, space and most importantly home are what comes to mind upon entering this fantastic property. To the front you will find a modern and fully equipped kitchen/dining area and to the rear a cosy reception room with a feature fireplace and fully tilled bathroom.\r\nTo the rear of this property is a magnificently spacious and sunny south-facing garden, perfect for long summer days with family and friends.\r\nUpstairs there are 2 double bedrooms, one being to the rear aspect and the other being to the front. These are accompanied by a fully tiled family bathroom in fantastic condition.\r\nUnrivalled in location, this property is within close proximity to Inchicore, Crumlin Children’s Hospital, St. James Hospital and the City Centre.\r\nThe property is well serviced by a host of regular bus routes as well as a short 4 minute stroll to Goldenbridge Red LUAS stop. The M50 is also only a short distance away and provides easy access to most major route-ways as well as an express route to Dublin Airport.\r\nEarly viewing is recommended as interest will be high.\r\nViewing by appointment only."
      },
